<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>For You 💜</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;padding:18px;background:#100d18;color:#f8f3ff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;min-height:100vh}
main{max-width:480px;margin:18px auto;background:#1c1728;border:1px solid #493365;border-radius:24px;padding:24px 18px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 10px 35px #0007}
.tag{color:#c7a7ff;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px}
h1{font-size:34px;color:#d9c1ff;margin:15px 0 8px}
h2{color:#d9c1ff}
.sub{font-size:18px;color:#fff}
p{line-height:1.6;color:#ded5e9}
.gift{font-size:58px;margin:12px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:11px;margin:22px 0}
button{font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}
.tile{border:1px solid #674b8c;background:#292039;color:#f4eaff;border-radius:16px;padding:18px 8px;min-height:112px}
.tile span{display:block;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:8px}
.tile small{display:block;color:#c4a9e8;margin-top:7px}
.tile:active,.primary:active{transform:scale(.98)}
.message{display:none;text-align:left;background:#292039;border:1px solid #674b8c;border-radius:14px;padding:14px;margin:10px 0;line-height:1.6}
.message.show{display:block}
.primary{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:30px;padding:14px;background:#9b70d2;color:white;margin-top:10px}
.primary:disabled{opacity:.4}
#last{display:none;background:#302342;border-radius:18px;padding:18px;margin-top:18px;line-height:1.7}
#last.show{display:block}
footer{font-size:12px;color:#aa96bf;margin-top:20px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<div class="tag">A SMALL SURPRISE FOR YOU</div>
<div class="gift">🎁</div>
<h1>A Little Gift For You 💜</h1>
<div class="sub">Sorry, My Favourite Human 🥺</div>
<p>Hey you! I made this just for you. Open all four little surprises. No skipping! 😄</p>

<div class="grid">
<button class="tile" onclick="openGift(0)"><span>🌟</span>A reminder<small id="s0">Tap to open</small></button>
<button class="tile" onclick="openGift(1)"><span>💌</span>An apology<small id="s1">Tap to open</small></button>
<button class="tile" onclick="openGift(2)"><span>😂</span>A smile<small id="s2">Tap to open</small></button>
<button class="tile" onclick="openGift(3)"><span>🤝</span>A promise<small id="s3">Tap to open</small></button>
</div>

<div id="m0" class="message"><b>🌟 A reminder</b><br>Your friendship matters to me. Even when we don't talk, I still appreciate the good moments we've shared.</div>
<div id="m1" class="message"><b>💌 An apology</b><br>I'm genuinely sorry I missed your call. I didn't mean to make you feel ignored. I should have let you know.</div>
<div id="m2" class="message"><b>😂 A smile</b><br>Official announcement: You're allowed to be annoyed, but you're not allowed to forget how awesome our friendship is. 😄</div>
<div id="m3" class="message"><b>🤝 A promise</b><br>I'll try to communicate better next time. I hope we can talk honestly whenever something bothers us.</div>

<button id="finish" class="primary" onclick="showFinal()" disabled>Open the final surprise 💜</button>
<div id="last">
<div style="font-size:38px">🥹💜</div>
<h2>Still Angry? 😂❤️</h2>
I really am sorry I missed your call. I care about our friendship, and I hope this little surprise makes you smile. No pressure to reply immediately. Whenever you're ready, let's talk.
<p><b>From your friend 💜</b></p>
</div>
<footer>Made with care • One small gift, just for you</footer>
</main>
<script>
var opened=[false,false,false,false];
function openGift(n){
 document.getElementById('m'+n).className='message show';
 document.getElementById('s'+n).textContent='Opened ✓';
 opened[n]=true;
 document.getElementById('finish').disabled=!opened.every(Boolean);
}
function showFinal(){
 document.getElementById('last').className='show';
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
